Day 26
-------

1)get methods
2)conditional methods
3)browser methods
4)navigational methods
5)wait methods


1)get methods - we can access these methods through webdriver instance
--------------
get(url) - opens the url on the browser
getTitle() - returns the title of the page
getCurrentUrl() - returns URL of the page
getPageSource() - returns the source code of the page
getWindowHandle() - returns ID of the single browser window
getWindowHandles() - returns ID's of the multiple browser windows



getWindowHandles() : To handle noSuchElement exception we are using Thread.sleep(ms)


to close windows using automation by using
driver.close() -> close single browser window at a time
driver.quit() -> close multiple browser window at a time




2)conditional methods - Access these commands through WebElement
---------------------
returns Boolean value(true/false)

isDisplayed() - we can check the display status of the element
isEnabled()  - we can check enable/disable status of the element
isSelected() - we can use to check the element is selected or not
